<title>USA: Zions Bancorp sets qtly div at $0.44.</title>
<headline>Zions Bancorp sets qtly div at $0.44.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY, Utah 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bancorp said its board of directors had declared a quarterly dividend of $0.44 per common share for shareholders of record on January 7, which would be payable on January 28.</p>
<p>The company said the board also authorized a repurchase of $25 million worth of common shares as part of its pending acquisition of Aspen Bancshares.</p>
<p>Zions signed a definitive agreement to merge with Aspen in a $75 million deal last month. Zions is to incorporate Aspen in exchange for shares in Zions.</p>
</text>
